      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I was going around to friends and specifically looking at what their shortened names would be while this update was still in beta and some of the results are ridiculous. \nYou can not expect to take the thousands of names people use of varying lengths, special characters, languages and forcefully only display any limited number of those characters. You butcher the name, and thus their identity.\nHopefully these aggressive marketing approaches dont continue when implementing other vrc+ features. This feature request, or similar, is a solid idea to help compromise between the forced character limit and still allowing some identity back into the name.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
